{"id":"d7469176894ed5c8","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion.md","title":"Criterion for Quantifier Elimination","display":"thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion — Criterion for Quantifier Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion","aliases":["17-thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion"],"display":"thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion — Criterion for Quantifier Elimination","depends_on":["[[17-df-quantifier-elimination]]","[[17-df-qfdiag]]","[[17-df-theory-properties]]","[[17-df-model]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed","legacy_label":"17-thm-1.5.2","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quantifier-elimination-criterion — Criterion for Quantifier Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e318e28bff8754a3\" href=\"?note=e318e28bff8754a3\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-elimination\">17-df-quantifier-elimination</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9e252481051482c9\" href=\"?note=9e252481051482c9\" title=\"17-df-qfdiag\">17-df-qfdiag</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"not-compared-to-book-in-this-pass; local statement reviewed"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-1.5.2"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cup\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak C)\">\\(T\\cup\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak C)\\)</span> 的完全性在命名语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak C)\">\\(L(\\mathfrak C)\\)</span> 中判断，不在原语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 中判断。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QE}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{QE}_L\\)</span> (quantifier-elimination predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e318e28bff8754a3\" href=\"?note=e318e28bff8754a3\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-elimination\">17-df-quantifier-elimination</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QFDiag}\">\\(\\operatorname{QFDiag}\\)</span> (quantifier-free diagram, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9e252481051482c9\" href=\"?note=9e252481051482c9\" title=\"17-df-qfdiag\">17-df-qfdiag</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> (semantic completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (model class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_L\">\\(\\subseteq_L\\)</span> (substructure relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak C\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak C\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\cup\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak C)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak C)}\">\\(T\\cup\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak C)\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak C)}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak C\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n(\\mathfrak C\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak A)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Complete}\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak C)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QE}_L(T)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak C\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl[\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n(\\mathfrak C\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak A)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\operatorname{Complete}\n\\bigl(T\\cup\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak C)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the Robinson diagram criterion. Completeness on the right is taken in the constant expansion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak C)\">\\(L(\\mathfrak C)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-quantifier-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"e318e28bff8754a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-quantifier-elimination]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-qfdiag","status":"resolved","id":"9e252481051482c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-qfdiag]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-substructure","status":"resolved","id":"71ede582cb78a069","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-quantifier-elimination","status":"resolved","id":"e318e28bff8754a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{QE}_L$ (quantifier-elimination predicate, see [[17-df-quantifier-elimination]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-qfdiag","status":"resolved","id":"9e252481051482c9","an